  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Tripletongue's Claws** is 3.": "Mientras esta unidad tenga 10 o más puntos de daño, la característica de Attacks de **Tripletongue's Claws** es 3.",
  "If this unit's **Fecula Flyblown** is on the battlefield, add 1 to its power level for the rest of the turn.": "",
