  "Subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target this unit while it is contesting an objective you control.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Gathoblyt's Fanged Maw** is 3.": "Mientras esta unidad tenga 10 o más puntos de daño, la característica de Attacks de **Gathoblyt's Fanged Maw** es 3.",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Pox Maggoth's Claws** is 3.": "",
  "**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):\r\nCover, Impassable**": "**Las siguientes habilidades universales de escenografía se aplican a este elemento de escenografía (Terrain, 1.2):\nCover, Impassable**",
