  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.": "Tira un dado. Con un 3+, suma 1 a la característica de Attacks de las armas de cuerpo a cuerpo del objetivo durante el resto del turno.",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Colossal Blight Weapons** is 3.": "",
