  "Pick a visible enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 12\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's **Flyrider's Arsenal** for attacks that target enemy units contesting an objective.": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit that was picked to be the target of a spell that was successfully cast by this unit this phase to be the target.": "",
