  "Your hero has the **^^Daemon^^**, **^^Wizard (1)^^** and **^^Ward (5+)^^* keywords and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** units": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to wound rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units that target that enemy unit for the rest of the turn.": "Tira un dado. Con un 3+, añade 1 a las tiradas de herida de los ataques de combate realizados por unidades amigas **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** que tengan como objetivo esa unidad enemiga durante el resto del turno.",
  "**^^Monster^^** only. Add the 'Corrosive to the Touch' ability to your hero's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade if your hero has another **^^Rampage^^** ability.": "",
  "Remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 12\" of this unit and more than 3\" from all enemy units, objectives, and other terrain features.": "",
  "This unit's **Pestilent Pollutants** are tokens. This unit has 2 **Pestilent Pollutants**. Pick an objective or terrain feature within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if the target is in combat with any other friendly **^^Rotbringers^^** units. On a 3+, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "When using the 'Blessed by the Plaguefather' ability, if you choose to infect an enemy unit, you can pick an enemy unit that is contesting an objective that is **seeded with rot**.": "",
  "Spend 1 **rage dice**. If your opponent's **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, give this unit D3 ritual points.": "",
  "Each time an enemy unit in combat with this unit uses the 'All-out Defence' or 'All-out Attack' command, the effect of that command also applies to this unit for the rest of the phase.": "",
  "Each time you make an unmodified save roll of 6 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "Cada vez que hagas una tirada de salvación sin modificar de 6 contra un ataque de combate que tenga como objetivo esta unidad, inflige 1 de daño mortal a la unidad atacante después de que se haya resuelto la habilidad de **^^Fight^^**.",
  "This unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "Esta unidad puede usar habilidades de **^^Charge^^** aunque haya usado una habilidad de **^^Retreat^^** en el mismo turno. Además, esta unidad no recibe daño mortal por habilidades de **^^Retreat^^**.",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 6\" of this unit or a friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaw** and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Subtract twice the current battle round number from the target's control score for the rest of the turn. If the chanting roll was 10+, this ability affects all enemy units within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Enemy **^^Manifestations^^** cannot be set up within 12\" of this unit and cannot pass through or end a move within this unit's combat range unless they started that move within this unit's combat range.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, pick the closest enemy unit to it to be the target. If 2 or more enemy units are tied to be the closest, you can pick which is the target. Then, make a charge roll of 2D6.": "Si esta unidad no está en combate, elige como objetivo la unidad enemiga más cercana a ella. Si 2 o más unidades enemigas empatan como la más cercana, puedes elegir cuál es el objetivo. Después, haz una tirada de carga de 2D6.",
  "If the target is a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit, **Heal (D3)** the target. If the target is an enemy unit, roll a dice. On a 3+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "Pick each enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the enemy targets, then pick each friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit within 18\" of this unit to be the friendly targets. Then, make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Roll a dice for each target. On a 2+:\r\n• If the target is not in combat, it can move a number of inches equal to the roll but cannot end that move in combat.\r\n• If the target is in combat, it can make a pile-in move.": "",
  "Your hero's non-**Companion** melee weapons have **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is one of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**.": "",
  "If there is no more than 1 friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaw** on the battlefield, you can set up a **Feculent Gnarlmaw** wholly within 12\" of this unit and more than 3\" from all enemy units, objectives and other terrain features.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Daemon^^** and **^^Ward (5+)^^* keywords and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** units\r\nIn addition, replace your hero's melee weapon with a **Pestilential Weapon**.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, while the target is in combat with both this unit and another friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for attacks that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "Place 2 of this unit's **Pestilent Pollutants** next to the target. If both of this unit's **Pestilent Pollutants** are already on the battlefield, pick 1 of them, remove it from the battlefield and place it next to the target instead.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 2+, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:\r\n***Tally of Blows:*** Add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks.\r\n***Recorded Stamina:*** Add 5 to the target's control score.": "",
  "While any friendly **Nurglings** units are wholly within 12\" of this unit:\r\n• Ignore the first damage point that would be allocated to that **Nurglings* unit each phase.\r\n• That **Nurglings** unit can ignore the effect of the 'Beast' ability.": "",
  "Roll a D3. If the target is within 6\" of a friendly **Sloven Knights** unit, you can roll a D6 instead. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's attacks until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Add 3\" to the range of this unit's 'Befouled Rainfall' ability for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.\r\nThen, inflict 1 mortal damage on each enemy unit within range of that ability.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 4+, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• The target cannot move and cannot be removed from the battlefield by an ability that would allow it to be set up elsewhere on the battlefield. \r\n• Add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "Each time a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this terrain feature uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 1 additional rally roll of D6. If that unit is a non-**^^Hero^^** unit, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6 instead.": "",
  "For each enemy unit that was in combat with this unit this turn and was destroyed this turn, this unit gains D3 **leech points** for the rest of the battle. Until the end of the next turn, add 1 to this unit's Control characteristic for each leech point it currently has.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Rotbringers^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Rotbringers^^** units\r\nIn addition, change your hero's Health characteristic to 7, change their Save characteristic to 3+, and replace their melee weapon with a **Great Blight Weapon**.": "",
  "Pick any number of this unit's **Mire Kelpies** and remove them from the battlefield. Then, roll a dice, adding 1 to the roll for each **Mire Kelpie** you removed this phase. On an unmodified roll of 1, this ability has no effect. On a 6+, the target has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects to apply for the rest of the turn:\r\n• Add 1 to casting rolls for friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizards^^** while they are within 3\" of this unit.\r\n• Add 1 to chanting rolls for friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priests^^** while they are within 3\" of this unit.": "",
  "This unit can move a distance up to the value of the charge roll. During that move, this unit can move into combat and can pass through models in the target unit, but it must end that move within 1/2\" of the target. Then, inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. If it does so, this unit has charged.": "",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target, to a maximum of 7 mortal damage. If any mortal damage was inflicted on the target, and the target was not a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature, it has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.": "",
  "Inflict 1 mortal damage on each enemy target and **Heal (1)** each friendly target. Then, until the start of your next turn, if an ability would heal or return any slain models to an enemy unit while they are within 18\" of this unit, that ability does not heal any damage points or return any slain models to it.": "",
  "Set up this unit on the battlefield, wholly within 7\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units. Then set up every other friendly unit that is **aboard the Slime Fleet** on the battlefield wholly within 7\" of a battlefield edge, wholly within 7\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again more than 9\" from all enemy units and wholly within 3\" of:\r\n• An objective or terrain feature that has a friendly **Pestilent Pollutant**, or\r\n• A **^^Polluted^^** terrain feature (see Gelgus Pust's 'Master Contaminator' ability), or\r\n• An objective you control": "",
  "Add the **Rot Fly's Mouthparts and Sting** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 8\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 8.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Pick up to 2 friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the targets. After the 'Counter-charge' command for this unit has been resolved, if this unit charged, each of the targets can immediately use the 'Counter-charge' command in an order of your choosing without any command points being spent.": "",
  "Roll a dice for each target. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, pick 1 of the following to apply for the rest of the turn:\r\n• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's combat attacks.\r\n• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's combat attacks.\r\n• Subtract 1 from the target's Control characteristic.": "",
  "This unit gains 1 **leech point** for the rest of the battle. Until the start of your next turn, each time the target uses a **^^Core^^** ability or command, after that ability has been resolved, roll a dice. On a 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target. Then, if any damage points were allocated to the target by this ability, **Heal (1)** this unit.": "",
  "Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. Then, inflict 1 mortal damage on each other **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit within 3\" of the target. If the chanting roll is 9+, you can also pick a friendly **Plaguebearers** unit within 12\" of the target. For each enemy **^^Infantry^^** model slain by this ability this turn, you can return 1 slain model to that friendly unit.": "",
  "When picking an enemy unit to be the target of the 'infect' effect of the 'Blessed by the Plaguefather' ability, you can pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it by this unit's shooting attacks this turn to be the target, even if that unit is not within 7\" of any friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, this terrain feature has a Move characteristic of 3\" and can immediately move 3\". It cannot move through or end that move within the combat ranges of enemy units and it cannot end that move on an objective or another terrain feature.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *This terrain feature cannot use* **^^Move^^**, **^^Run^^***,* **^^Retreat^^** *or* **^^Charge^^** *abilities.*": "",
  "You gain a number of **tally points** equal to the current battle round number.\r\nDuring the battle round, you can spend your **tally points**. For each **tally point** you spend, you can re-roll 1 hit roll, 1 wound roll, 1 save roll or 1 ward roll for a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit.\r\nAt the end of the battle round, any unspent **tally points** are lost.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **Plaguebearers** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Add the **Pox Maggoth's Claws** weapon and the 'Battle Damaged' ability to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 8\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 14.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.": "",
  "You and your opponent must roll off. Add the target's Control characteristic to your roll and add the intubator's Control characteristic to your opponent's roll. If your roll equals or exceeds your opponent's, set up a replacement unit for the target with 4 damage points allocated to it within 3\" of the incubator. Then, if your roll is at least double your opponent's, the incubator is automatically destroyed.": "",
  "You and your opponent must roll off. Add this unit's Control characteristic to your roll and the target's Control characteristic to your opponent's roll. If your roll is higher, apply the corresponding effect:\r\n• If the target is a **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^**, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the difference between your roll and your opponent's roll.\r\n• If the target is a non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Monster^^** unit, 1 model in the target unit is slain.": "",
  "While a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit is wholly within 6\" of a **^^Polluted^^** terrain feature, each time that unit uses or is the target of an ability that would heal 1 or more damage points, add 1 to the number of damage points healed.\r\nWhile an enemy unit is within 6\" of a **^^Polluted^^** terrain feature, each time that unit uses or is the target of an ability that would heal 1 or more damage points, subtract 1 from the number of damage points healed, to a minimum of 0.": "",
  "Roll a dice.\r\n• If the target is a **^^Wizard^^** and the roll exceeds the target's power level, until the start of your next turn, each time a casting roll for the target includes 2 or more rolls of 1, 2 or more rolls of 2 or 2 or more rolls of 3, the spell is miscast.\r\n• If the target is a **^^Priest^^** and the roll exceeds the target's power level, until the start of your next turn, each time your opponent makes an unmodified chanting roll of 1 or 2 for the target, the prayer fails, its effect is not resolved and your opponent must remove D3 ritual points from the target. In addition, your opponent cannot give that **^^Priest^^** any ritual points for the rest of the phase.": "",
  "If you picked a friendly unit to be the target, roll a dice. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, add 2 to run rolls and charge rolls for the target until the start of your next turn.\r\nIf you picked an enemy unit to be the target, roll a dice. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, until the start of your next turn, while this unit is on the battlefield, inflict D3 mortal damage on the target:\r\n• Each time the target ends a move further from this unit than it was at the start of the move, after the ability used by the target has been resolved.\r\n• Each time the target is removed from the battlefield and set up again on the battlefield further from the unit than it was before it was removed, after the ability used by the target has been resolved.": ""
}
